          <div class="p-8 relative z-10 sm:flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="mb-6 sm:mb-0 sm:mr-6">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Join the Conversation</h3>
              <p class="text-blue-100">Connect with other members online via our private Mensa Connect portal and social media groups.</p>
